-### Formulas
-**VQ Loss ($L_{vq}$):**
-$$
-L_{vq} = ||\gamma(\mathbf{x}) - \mathbf{y}||_2^2 + ||sg(\mathbf{z}_e) - \mathbf{z}||_2^2 + \beta ||\mathbf{z}_e - sg(\mathbf{z})||_2^2
-$$
+    a. Compute density $\sigma$ and color $\mathbf{c}$ using the Radiance Field MLP, conditioned by the routed latent [S1].
